a, Bran\u015flar Karmas\u0131<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bu yay\u0131nevlerinin T\u00fcrkiye geneli deneme s\u0131navlar\u0131, ayn\u0131 anda binlerce \u00f6\u011frenciyle e\u015f zamanl\u0131 olarak kurumumuzda yap\u0131lmakta; \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin ger\u00e7ek s\u0131nav performanslar\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7me f\u0131rsat\u0131 sunulmaktad\u0131r.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Neden Deneme Kul\u00fcb\u00fc?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>100\u2019den fazla g\u00fcncel deneme s\u0131nav\u0131<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ger\u00e7ek YKS standartlar\u0131na uygun oturum d\u00fczeni<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>T\u00fcrkiye geneli ba\u015far\u0131 s\u0131ralamas\u0131 analizi<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bran\u015f bazl\u0131 geli\u015fim raporlar\u0131<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>D\u00fczenli deneme takvimi ve performans takibi<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>\u201cGaziosmanpa\u015fa\u2019n\u0131n En \u0130yi Deneme Kul\u00fcb\u00fc\u201d<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Her deneme, ba\u015far\u0131ya bir ad\u0131m daha yakla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Biz, sadece s\u0131nav yapt\u0131rm\u0131yoruz \u2014 \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin performanslar\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcyor, geli\u015fim s\u00fcre\u00e7lerini titizlikle takip ediyoruz.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat Deneme Kul\u00fcb\u00fc<\/strong>,<br><strong><em>\u201cDo\u011fru kayna\u011f\u0131, do\u011fru yerde, do\u011fru zamanda\u201d sunar.<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u201cBa\u015far\u0131ya Giden Yolun En G\u00fcvenilir S\u0131nav Merkezi\u201d \u00